  data: {
    LLM: "The Seven (Mariglia) is the most powerful card - 5 points and unbeatable in its suit. Guard your Sevens and Aces. Remember Jacks outrank Queens.\n\nCreate voids by discarding your only card of a suit on a trick your partner is winning. This lets you trump when that suit is led later. Track which high cards have been played.\n\nCommunication strategy: The stronger partner should take control, asking specific questions while revealing minimal information. Coordinate to capture opponent's high cards. The dealer's immediate scoring from the trump indicator can be decisive - if you turn up a 7 of trumps, you score 5 points instantly.",
